                                                "sense_id": "e05b202a-b0ca-3bf4-8c69-6c14089c277b",
                                                "text": "Eventually, he was named the world’s tallest male dog, taking over the title from fellow Great Dane Zeus who also died aged three in September, after suffering from bone cancer."
